OL,3,GNEWSAPolice praise victims of Army
OL,4,ACadets sex abuser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has praised the
OL,7,Fvictims of an Army Cadets leader who
OL,8,Fsexually abused them for speaking to
OL,9,Fpolice and in court.
OL,11,FRylan Ray was found guilty of 23 sexual
OL,12,Foffences, many involving teenage boys,
OL,13,Fon Thursday. He had already admitted
OL,14,Fanother five charges.
OL,16,FThe case involved 11 male victims, many
OL,17,Fof whom the 26-year-old, of Westgate,
OL,18,FPeterborough, met through his role with
OL,19,Fthe Cambridgeshire Army Cadet Force.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
