OL,3,GNEWSAPolice praise victims of Army
OL,4,ACadets sex abuser
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Gordon Logan, from
OL,7,FCambridgeshire Police, said the victims
OL,8,F"should be really proud of themselves".
